% HDBS-2018-57 fig_01b: q qbar -> Z -> mu mu with a gamma*/Z* radiated off the mu+ line, giving 4 mu
layout: v2
in: i1 i2
out: f1 f2 f3 f4
i1 [q] -- a
i2 [qbar] -- a
a -- [Z] b
b -- [fermion] f1 [\mu^-]
f4 [\mu^+] -- [fermion] r -- [fermion] b
r -- [boson, label'=\gamma^*/Z^*] c
c -- [fermion] f2 [\mu^-]
f3 [\mu^+] -- [fermion] c
